   "lines": [
    "Emlen and I sail-",
    "-ed over ^across^ the sound,",
    "intending to go to",
    "Greenwich but struck",
    "the wrong side of",
    "Shippan Point",
    "and got into",
    "Darien; we had",
    "a fresh, full sail",
    "breeze.",
    "My horse has",
    "done wonderfully",
    "this season; I have",
    "not missed riding",
    "him a single day",
    "when at home; his",
    "back and legs have",
    "both stood beautifully."
   ],
